<title>USA: Bethlehem Township, Pa., adjusted TIC.</title>
<headline>Bethlehem Township, Pa., adjusted TIC.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hamilton Consulting, Inc, financial advisor for Bethlehem Township, Pa., said it recalculated First Union Capital Markets Corp's winning bid for the Township's $3.665 million general obligation bond issue.  First Union's winning true interest cost was now 5.53362 percent reflecting the cost of bond insurance, not the 5.4980 percent orginally calculated.</p>
